 in Workers #8174\u003e)\n\u0026gt; New subprocess API (\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/11016|Implement new two-tier subprocess API #11016\u003e, \u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/5501|Detached processes in deno #5501\u003e, \u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/pull/11618|feat(runtime): two-tier subprocess API #11618\u003e)\nこの辺りがぱっと見なんかありそうな気がしました","ts":"1632025054.137900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mmS2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"621bf2ab-46ce-49e5-9624-7db56f1af823","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"あーいや、checkhealth見ただけだからもしかしてサポートしてるバージョン上がってたりする……？","ts":"1632025008.137300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=D6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8aaf0698-5a63-46a2-aabc-3aed56ceb6f3","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"`deno.land/std@0.107.0` がdenopsでサポートしてる1.11.0で正常に動かないのに気付いた","ts":"1632024951.136900","thread_ts":"1632024951.136900","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pgX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bdc13435-374c-43bf-8034-6b30644b97cc","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003c@U776661HA\u003e 流し見しかしてないんですが、もしかしてdenopsにそれなりに影響ある・・・？\n\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C025RG58AAE/p1632024894321000\u003e","ts":"1632024925.136200","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/12110|#12110 Deno 2.0 Release Plan\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/12110|#12110 Deno 2.0 Release Plan\u003e","text":"*Schedule*\n\n• 12 October - Release of Deno 1.15\n• 19 October - Release of Deno 1.15.1\n• 26 October - Release of Deno 1.15.2\n• 27 October - Merge window for Deno 2.0 opens\n• 15 November - Feature _freeze_ for Deno 2.0\n• 22 November - Release of Deno 2.0\n\n*Scope*\n\n_Note, at this stage it is still subject to change as items get better refined. This is a working list._\n\n☐ Move JavaScript only \"stuff\" out of the Deno Namespace (#9795)\n☐ Enable `Deno` namespace by default in workers (#8174)\n☐ Don't type check be default (#11340)\n☐ New subprocess API (#11016, #5501, #11618)\n☐ JSON Modules (#7623)\n☐ Turn TypeScript `useUnknownInCatchVariables` on (#11826)\n☐ Remove deprecated `Deno.customInspect` (#10929)\n☐ Lockfile generated by default (#11971)\n☐ op metrics refactoring/cleanup (#12109)\n☐ Switch JSX/TSX default constructors (#11186)\n☐ Remove `Deno.read()` and `Deno.write()` (#12107)\n☐ Have a single configuration for TypeScript (#12111)\n☐ Internal Origin for Persistance (#11882)\n☐ Don't report check diagnostics for _external_ scripts by default (#11970)\n☐ Use `--allow-import` for dynamic imports and workers (#8266)\n☐ `NotCapable` error to distinguish between permissions and capabilities (#7394)","fields":[{"title":"Comments","value":"2","short":true},{"title":"Milestone","value":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/milestone/26|2.0.0\u003e","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno|denoland/deno\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1631837587,"original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C025RG58AAE/p1632024894321000"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9jC+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1fb6ff6a-90ee-443a-a5a4-f10d1287d1bd","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"GhostTextでWebSocketにhyper使おうと思ったらRust層のエラー踏んで非常にめんどくさい事になった","ts":"1632023476.135500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5ZC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aaa09f7f-1e20-4228-8282-00f38acbcc2c","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"`const SIGTERM = (Deno as any).Signal?.SIGTERM ?? \"SIGTERM\";` 同じことしてたｗ","ts":"1632008149.134300","team":"T03C